  "evidence": [
    "Move Effect::init, ok_callback, button_hover_callback and EffectOkPitch to FX, whose real 97-element Effect array and FX::init own this application policy. Move input_callback to Ambience, owner of FactionMusic. Preserve bodies, declarations, annotations, hook store order, direct BaseWin call and all Wave global definitions in their existing order. This is semantic ownership, not inferred original TU identity.",
    "Fresh Wave controls against retained current application build establish /Ob2 raw COFF equality and ten exact initializers, but a same-TU inlining regression for ok_callback. Authorize a Wave-only /Ob2 measurement recipe only after the ownership split and fresh controls; do not change application build flags or other unit recipes. Ambience /Ob2 raw COFF did not match and is not authorized.",
    "All mappings in the three affected TUs are collateral measurement subjects. No other body rewrites, original-marker edits, claim demotions or bug fixes. Preserve historical obligations; any emitted symbol changes require native writer and physical proof.",
    "Require paired native comparisons, annotation/body/global-order conservation controls, fresh build/link and reference/claim continuity before coordinator-reviewed integration. Full-game acceptance and linked preservation remain unproven."
  ],
  "intent": "Separate application effect callback policy from generic Wave methods while preserving storage, initialization order and original behavior.",
